# Research-harness output: charts and per-trade CSVs written next to the module that made
# them. Regenerable from the DB by re-running the harness, never an input to anything, and
# a sweep drops a dozen at a time — 32 of them had accumulated untracked by 2026-09-07.
# Scoped by harness prefix so the tracked schema diagrams (pipeline_schema, data_model_schema,
# add_tools_vs_deep_agents) are not caught.
